    <string name="live_mode_info_label">About auto and manual</string>
    <string name="live_mode_info">With the sync button on, Start waits for the belt to move. Pausing the treadmill pauses the recording, and Stop on the console finishes it. If the belt stays still or the treadmill disconnects for a while, you’re asked whether to finish. With it off, you start, pause and stop here.</string>
